    <statement><p>Solve the separable differential equation for <m>u</m>  
<me>\frac{du}{dt} = e^{6 u + 10 t}.</me> 
Use the following initial condition: <m>u(0) = 14.</m></p>
<p><m>u =</m> <fillin characters="45" name="AnSwEr0001"/>.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{-\ln\mathopen{}\left(e^{-14\cdot 6}+\frac{6}{10}-\frac{6}{10}e^{10t}\right)}{6}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
